Z||000000||KillerX||12-17-2001||01:05 PM||||i was trying to take out the big consol thingy abouve the stering wheel so i could take out the vinal plastic thing behind it... does any1 know how to take out that hole speedo thing (i donno what to call it its the big thing that tells ya how fast yer goin, your rpm etc...i wanna just move that thing a little but i dont know where the screws are...)<BR>btw i have a 85gt<BR>ThanX||||reg||1
Z||000001||johnsimon||12-17-2001||01:10 PM||||I have an  85 GT too.<BR>Remove the top and  bottom covers, the fasteners are obvious.<BR>There are 2 bolts on the top of the assembly and 2 on the bottom that will be exposed after the covers are off.<BR>You have to then disconnect the harness from everything.<BR>It may be easier to remove the harness on the trunk; lights,defrost switches by removing the face plates right in front of the assembly<BR>Be carefull not to snap off the locks on the harness connecters.<P>------------------<BR>John Simon<BR>85 V6 GT||||reg||1
